# Normalize line endings so the repository, every developer machine, and CI
# hold byte-identical files. The formatter gate compares exact bytes, so a
# platform-dependent working tree would make it pass locally and fail on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
